00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:35.890
I didn't think I want to watch it, but the truth is I turned it on, and I was riveted.

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.950
It's very, very modern, isn't it? Don't you think?

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.190
Well, the story's very good.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:43.380
If an intelligence from another planet sends us a lot of technical data

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:45.880
from which we can build a computer which will think for us

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:51.330
and an anthropomorphic creature that will act for it, it's not for our benefit.

