Mary Morris.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:29.100
Cheers.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:34.400
A great character. I liked her very much, and we got on very well together.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.800
Oh, Professor Dormey.

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:37.360
Hello, my dear.

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:41.250
And so it was lovely that she was in this, because I already knew her.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.880
What the government needs now is world markets.

